# 1. Focus fire: every champion that starts a fight broadcasts the enemy via set_team_target, and the team's
#    team_target() is hit first whenever it is in reach, so two or three of us land on the same enemy in one turn.
# 2. First hit: the existing cast_on/attack sequence runs before any movement, and the attack-reset cast is used on the
#    same target, so the second basic attack lands in the same turn.
# 3. Retreat and re-engage: when local_strength(4) says the fight is lost, step away instead of trading. Below 30%
#    health the existing safe-recall logic takes over, and the bot re-engages only once healthy and with allies near.
